  "name": "airshipper",
  "description": "A specialized game launcher and distribution infrastructure designed for the Veloren voxel engine, featuring a comprehensive Rust-based ecosystem. It utilizes an Iced-powered GUI for client-side version management and a Rocket-based server for automated artifact ingestion from GitLab CI pipelines. The architecture integrates deeply with Nix for reproducible builds and employs asynchronous I/O to handle high-concurrency downloads and system process management.",
